
# Go template downloaded with gut

### Go ###
# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Extensionless Linux binaries (e.g. `go build ./cmd/solvent`)
/solvent
/solvent-mcp
/bin/

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

.gut

# Phase 3 corpus snapshot — fetched GitHub data, never committed.
# The canonical snapshot lives here (NDJSON + .meta.json) and is the artifact
# both local and cloud ingestion consume. It is reproducible via
# `task corpus:fetch`, so there is no reason to track it.
/corpus-data/
*.ndjson
